        // We cannot change msg.sender in Solidity, but the contract C's modifier onlyOptimisticAsserter enforces msg.sender == optimisticAsserter.
        // The only observable is that when msg.sender == optimisticAsserter, the call should not revert. To test that, we check whether optAsserter == address(this).
